00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:29.160
you walk in through the door. Maybe even

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.600
throw a few things away and say yes to

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:32.280
the interests you've been avoiding

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:34.080
because you feel like it maybe doesn't

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:36.720
fit your brand. Who's out here telling

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:39.440
you what your brand is? You. So whatever

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:41.680
you truly want to do and what you truly

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:43.520
feel like doing, follow those whims and

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:45.240
let it lead you to places that you want

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:46.440
to be. Your own unique sense of taste

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.160
and whimsy is something that you have to

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:50.320
stop hiding. It's already in here

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:52.240
somewhere and if not, you can always

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:53.680
develop it. And if you don't like the

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:55.120
way that you look for whatever reason,

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:56.720
like maybe you just don't like the

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:58.080
projection of what the external world

00:19:56.720 --> 00:20:00.360
made you out to be. Every single

00:19:58.080 --> 00:20:02.440
preference that you have suppressed,

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:04.560
every instinct that you have overridden,

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:06.280
and maybe even weird things about you

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:09.200
that you don't feel comfortable

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:10.920
expressing, all of those things can be

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:13.040
what makes you irreplaceable. Even if

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:15.560
it's a certain ideal that you currently

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:17.480
can't meet but you will someday, go all

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:19.480
in on everything that you love and trust

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:23.000
that you have absolutely nothing to lose

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:25.960
by becoming the fullest, most specific,

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:27.720
and most unapologetically alive version

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:29.880
of you because you really have nothing

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:31.960
to lose and everything to gain. So I

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:33.920
believe in you, angels. If you're here,

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.880
comment with me. Leave a comment and

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.800
say, "I am so whimsy. I have such a

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:39.040
unique sense of taste." Why not? I'm

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.720
here to affirm it with you. In the

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:43.200
meantime, I will see you in the next

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.200
video.

